// Polish strings for taskcell.dev: node build.mjs writes dist/pl/<file> from src/<file> with each English string
// swapped for its Polish one. Keys are files under src/; '*.html' holds the bar and footer strings every page shares.
// A string must match the English source exactly (markup included); one that no longer matches fails the build.
// To add a string: add its English text to src/, then a [english, polish] pair here under the same file.
// Names stay as they are: Taskcell, Hub, Self-host, pull request / PR, and the product's own labels and commands.

